      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. Value `141` triggers the PopulationCodec path (offset=0 → fdef=false, udef=false, tdef=false), which reads 3 bytes from the stream (each 0 → returns defaultCodec). The 9-byte stream gets fully buffered by `BufferedInputStream`, so `byteArrayInputStream0.available()` drops to 0. Let me write a clearer version.The improved test compiled successfully."
